[36m(TaskRunner pid=475120)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=475120)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in polar form as \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\). Then we can substitute this into the expression and find the real part.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=475120)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=475120)[0m The expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=475120)[0m \[
